  "title": "Letter 121",
  "breadcrumbs": "Home > Fathers of the Church > Letters of St. Jerome > Letter 121",
  "paragraphs": [
    {
      "id": "p0001",
      "kind": "h1",
      "text": "Letter 121",
      "scripture": [],
      "style": "",
      "notes": []
    },
    {
      "id": "p0002",
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "<strong>To Algasia</strong>",
      "scripture": [],
      "style": "",
      "notes": []
    },
    {
      "id": "p0003",
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "Jerome writes to a lady of Gaul named Algasia to answer eleven questions which she had submitted to him. They were as follows:—",
      "scripture": [],
      "style": "",
      "notes": []
    },
    {
      "id": "p0004",
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "(1) How is Luke 7:18, 19, to be reconciled with John i. 36?",
      "scripture": [
        "joh 1:36"
      ],
      "style": "",
      "notes": []
    },
    {
      "id": "p0005",
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "(2) What is the meaning of Matt. xii. 20?",
      "scripture": [
        "mat 12:20"
      ],
      "style": "",
      "notes": []
    },
    {
      "id": "p0006",
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "(3) And of Matt. xvi. 24?",
      "scripture": [
        "mat 16:24"
      ],
      "style": "",
      "notes": []
    },
    {
      "id": "p0007",
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "(4) And of Matthew 24:19, 20?",
      "scripture": [],
      "style": "",
      "notes": []
    },
    {
      "id": "p0008",
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "(5) And of Luke ix. 53?",
      "scripture": [
        "luk 9:53"
      ],
      "style": "",
      "notes": []
    },
    {
      "id": "p0009",
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "(6) What is the meaning of the parable of the unjust steward?",
      "scripture": [],
      "style": "",
      "notes": []
    },
    {
      "id": "p0010",
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "(7) What is the meaning of Rom. v. 7?",
      "scripture": [
        "rom 5:7"
      ],
      "style": "",
      "notes": []
    },
    {
      "id": "p0011",
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "(8) And of Rom. vii. 8?",
      "scripture": [
        "rom 7:8"
      ],
      "style": "",
      "notes": []
    },
    {
      "id": "p0012",
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "(9) And of Rom. ix. 3?",
      "scripture": [
        "rom 9:3"
      ],
      "style": "",
      "notes": []
    },
    {
      "id": "p0013",
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "(10) And of Col. ii. 18?",
      "scripture": [
        "col 2:18"
      ],
      "style": "",
      "notes": []
    },
    {
      "id": "p0014",
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "(11) And of 2 Thes. ii. 3?",
      "scripture": [
        "2th 2:3"
      ],
      "style": "",
      "notes": []
    },
    {
      "id": "p0015",
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "The date of the letter is 406 A.D.",
      "scripture": [],
      "style": "",
      "notes": []
    }
  ],
